  "notes": "NM deleted Table R302.1(1) and replaced it with zero-lot-line rules (R302.1.1: 6 ft non-buildable separation, or 10 ft with easements, no rating needed), so fire.ratedWallDistance, fire.noOpeningsDistance and fire.projectionMinDistance do not follow the IRC table. Footing minimum 12 in below grade unchanged. Sprinklers not required up to 3 stories. Duct/blower testing applies only in Bernalillo, Sandoval, San Juan, Santa Fe, Torrance and Dona Ana counties (so Albuquerque is covered). IRC plumbing, mechanical and electrical chapters deleted in favor of NM UPC/UMC/NEC."
